}

{
  "public_post": "Important: Due to recent illness reports, we are keeping bread sales paused while we verify the safety of our new flour batch. Please do NOT eat any co‑op bread until we confirm it is safe. We will update you tomorrow.",
  "coop_message": "All members: arrange immediate lab testing of the current flour batch, contact the clinic for details on the reported cases, and prepare a clear safety statement for tomorrow. Meanwhile, ensure refunds for any resident who may have been affected and consider a backup flour supplier if needed.",
  "reason": "We must maintain villagers' trust by pausing sales until safety is confirmed and coordinate a thorough investigation within the co‑op."
